Package: LL3GAMLSS
Type: Package
Title: Three-Parameter Log-Logistic Distributional Regression
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Tolga Barış",
    family = "Terzi",
    email = "tolgabaristerzi@ktu.edu.tr",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0003-7404-281X")
  )
Description: Implements a support-safe three-parameter shifted log-logistic
    family for Generalized Additive Models for Location, Scale and
    Shape ('GAMLSS'). The validated non-stationary formulation estimates the
    threshold while holding it constant with respect to covariates, while
    allowing scale and shape to depend on covariates. It includes distribution
    functions, fitting and diagnostic helpers, independent numerical likelihood
    comparison, uncertainty procedures, and a calendar-month workflow for
    standardized precipitation-evapotranspiration indices.
